      "writtenOn": "2022-08-19T23:15:05Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "To be precise, the race might be in cpufreq.c, but it is induced by something in your vendor-specific cpufreq governor, correct? If it is purely a race in the upstream code, then this should be fixed upstream.",
      "parentUuid": "4d3cb312_641cfe3b",
      "revId": "eb610069f2ef107d84f1db0bf66ae090c7e258ba",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
